WEBVTT

01:36.020 --> 01:38.280
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.500 --> 01:41.289
[Episode 17]

01:46.470 --> 01:47.750
[Hailan University]

01:47.780 --> 01:49.580
[Aren't they friends?]

01:49.600 --> 01:51.420
[So sweet.]

02:03.360 --> 02:07.790
[Knock and then come in]

02:04.040 --> 02:04.960
Who are you?

02:05.120 --> 02:07.520
Don't you know "first come, first served"?

02:09.979 --> 02:10.900
Chen Zhihan.

02:11.580 --> 02:13.580
You knew clearly I like Tong Xiaole,

02:13.600 --> 02:15.040
yet you hypocritically
gave me his WeChat ID

02:15.040 --> 02:17.160
and hid the fact that you two are dating!

02:17.160 --> 02:19.290
Did you have to humiliate me like that?

02:19.480 --> 02:20.320
I'm sorry.

02:20.680 --> 02:22.320
I indeed was in the wrong.

02:22.320 --> 02:23.320
He and I indeed...

02:30.920 --> 02:33.190
Don't even mention Yi Lan.

02:33.210 --> 02:34.540
She's driving me crazy.

02:35.950 --> 02:38.040
And our high school classmate, Luo Ningzi.

02:38.040 --> 02:38.650
Do you still remember her?

02:38.650 --> 02:40.480
Her family used to be pretty rich, right?

02:40.480 --> 02:43.320
Later, for some unknown reason,
they went bankrupt.

02:43.320 --> 02:45.180
Now she's busy with socializing,

02:46.070 --> 02:47.480
networking everywhere for money.

02:47.480 --> 02:49.010
What are you talking about?

02:51.600 --> 02:53.400
Why did you eavesdrop on my call?

03:01.600 --> 03:02.350
So impolite.

03:02.790 --> 03:03.870
Hey, don't run!

03:03.920 --> 03:04.440
Lan.

03:06.570 --> 03:07.500
Just ignore her.

03:08.070 --> 03:09.720
Please don't take it to heart.

03:09.720 --> 03:11.450
She was just spreading rumors.

03:11.880 --> 03:12.980
What have you been up to lately?

03:12.980 --> 03:15.440
Let's have a meal together
when you're free.

03:15.760 --> 03:16.390
Tonight,

03:16.430 --> 03:18.920
would you like to come to the restaurant
where I work part-time to watch me play?

03:18.920 --> 03:19.450
My treat.

03:19.920 --> 03:20.480
Sure.

03:20.620 --> 03:21.040
Mm.

03:21.829 --> 03:22.430
It's fine.

03:22.760 --> 03:24.090
I'm going to rehearsal.

03:27.930 --> 03:29.590
Always eating skewers is a bit boring.

03:29.590 --> 03:30.200
Hot pot?

03:31.010 --> 03:32.390
Something like that.

03:33.200 --> 03:34.040
Our bro came.

03:35.160 --> 03:37.220
Weren't you in the restroom?
That took forever.

03:37.220 --> 03:38.200
Sorry, let's go.

03:38.579 --> 03:39.290
Let's go.

03:39.630 --> 03:40.600
So, where to?

03:39.740 --> 03:42.230
[Lutao Free Restaurant]

03:40.600 --> 03:42.530
We haven't decided what to eat yet.

03:46.829 --> 03:47.720
Lan!

03:50.510 --> 03:52.579
Why are you wearing my coat?

03:52.720 --> 03:53.500
Why did you...

03:53.500 --> 03:55.300
Why did you come outside to wait?

03:55.850 --> 03:57.860
Why are you wearing my coat?

03:58.160 --> 04:00.160
Riding the electric scooter at night
is cold.

04:00.160 --> 04:01.960
I was worried you might get cold.

04:02.160 --> 04:03.320
So thoughtful.

04:04.290 --> 04:05.210
Let me tell you,

04:05.230 --> 04:07.320
Ning played really well today.

04:07.480 --> 04:08.040
I'm thinking,

04:08.040 --> 04:09.070
maybe if I get a chance,

04:09.070 --> 04:10.600
I could
find a part-time job like this too.

04:10.600 --> 04:12.400
It might help me improve myself.

04:13.320 --> 04:14.600
I don't think...

04:14.780 --> 04:15.440
you need to.

04:15.670 --> 04:16.230
Why?

04:16.640 --> 04:17.310
Because...

04:18.190 --> 04:20.600
my girlfriend is already super amazing.

04:20.640 --> 04:21.600
Really?

04:21.600 --> 04:22.790
Of course.

04:23.750 --> 04:25.280
Did Chen Fan come today too?

04:25.860 --> 04:26.960
I don't know. Why?

04:27.110 --> 04:28.700
I think I saw him.

04:29.220 --> 04:30.510
How has he been lately?

04:31.520 --> 04:32.520
I think

04:33.200 --> 04:35.780
he should have the ability
to sort himself out.

04:35.780 --> 04:36.790
But as for you,

04:37.180 --> 04:39.080
can you take better care of yourself?

04:39.080 --> 04:40.000
What about me?

04:41.110 --> 04:42.159
How come I heard

04:42.450 --> 04:44.710
someone has been bullying you at school?

04:45.040 --> 04:45.920
It's nothing.

04:45.920 --> 04:46.909
I can handle it myself.

04:46.909 --> 04:48.980
If someone bullies you,
that's a serious matter!

04:48.980 --> 04:50.280
From now on, no matter what happens,

04:50.280 --> 04:51.210
you must tell me.

04:51.220 --> 04:51.720
Got it?

04:51.720 --> 04:52.550
Okay, okay.

04:52.550 --> 04:54.610
I'll tell you everything from now on.

05:29.520 --> 05:30.320
Are you tired?

05:31.720 --> 05:32.280
No.

05:31.920 --> 05:35.350
♪ The story begins with hand in hand ♪

05:32.550 --> 05:33.310
Really?

05:33.470 --> 05:34.180
Really.

05:34.930 --> 05:36.090
Occupied. Occupied. Occupied.

05:36.090 --> 05:37.690
Occupied. Occupied. Occupied.

05:36.600 --> 05:38.620
♪ For no reason at all ♪

05:38.880 --> 05:41.490
♪ I just want to walk with you ♪

05:41.600 --> 05:44.190
See? You got up late.
The practice rooms are all occupied.

05:42.760 --> 05:46.580
♪ Simply until we grow old ♪

05:47.690 --> 05:51.490
♪ Every warm touch that drew us closer ♪

05:52.140 --> 05:54.180
♪ Was nothing but a dream ♪

05:52.159 --> 05:53.430
It's this piece.

05:53.720 --> 05:54.750
They play really well.

05:54.650 --> 05:58.090
♪ So many sunrises and sunsets ♪

05:55.110 --> 05:55.790
Mm.

05:57.010 --> 05:58.380
Not as good as your playing.

05:58.380 --> 06:02.220
♪ Have changed our original hearts ♪

06:02.920 --> 06:06.010
♪ By not thinking about it or guessing ♪

06:06.390 --> 06:09.340
♪ I thought I could break free ♪

06:09.510 --> 06:15.830
♪ Time has shown
I'm not as carefree as I imagined ♪

06:18.090 --> 06:22.050
♪ I still can't forget the tenderness
you gave me that year ♪

06:22.130 --> 06:25.790
♪ Exhausting all my strength,
I still can't fool myself ♪

06:26.160 --> 06:29.320
♪ Your place is still here ♪

06:29.470 --> 06:33.270
♪ No one else can take it ♪

06:34.070 --> 06:37.630
♪ Let me treat it as just a heavy rain ♪

06:37.860 --> 06:42.470
♪ Gradually, the memories we've built
become clear ♪

06:42.630 --> 06:46.970
♪ All composed into a song ♪

06:48.270 --> 06:51.530
♪ It's still so beautiful ♪

06:52.040 --> 06:52.790
You passed.

06:53.870 --> 06:54.430
Yes!

06:58.080 --> 06:59.480
Thank you, Professor Ye.

07:00.080 --> 07:01.840
But your technique
still needs improvement.

07:01.840 --> 07:03.840
From now on, practice 4 hours every day.

07:03.840 --> 07:05.640
I guarantee I will complete the task.

07:05.640 --> 07:07.570
I'll get going then, Professor Ye.

07:12.520 --> 07:13.320
Professor Ye,

07:14.260 --> 07:16.680
I want to... ask you a question.

07:17.280 --> 07:17.810
Go ahead.

07:19.720 --> 07:21.180
How are things between you

07:21.310 --> 07:22.280
and Shan now?

07:24.040 --> 07:25.290
Shan is my brother.

07:25.320 --> 07:27.120
I've known him since childhood.

07:27.180 --> 07:29.090
So I care about how he's doing.

07:29.960 --> 07:30.960
I can tell

07:31.530 --> 07:33.390
he has always loved you very much.

07:34.280 --> 07:35.520
So, what...

07:36.520 --> 07:37.140
are...

07:37.280 --> 07:38.280
your thoughts?

07:46.640 --> 07:47.640
Sometimes,

07:48.159 --> 07:51.220
2 people who love each other deeply
can still separate.

07:56.870 --> 07:58.800
It's best if you don't understand.

07:59.280 --> 08:00.480
Focus on practicing.

08:00.520 --> 08:00.960
Mm?

08:11.500 --> 08:12.970
What makes you so happy?

08:13.400 --> 08:15.310
Xiaole!

08:16.600 --> 08:18.600
I passed Professor Ye's interview!

08:18.740 --> 08:19.280
Really?

08:19.400 --> 08:20.310
Yes!

08:21.080 --> 08:22.770
Congratulations!

08:22.830 --> 08:24.070
But

08:24.190 --> 08:26.080
she said my technique isn't good enough.

08:26.080 --> 08:27.060
I need special training.

08:27.060 --> 08:28.620
At least 4 hours every day.

08:28.760 --> 08:31.950
That means the time I spend with you
will be a little bit less.

08:31.950 --> 08:32.830
It's okay.

08:32.850 --> 08:34.600
I'll be very busy too.

08:34.950 --> 08:38.640
A professor in my department helped me
get a part-time job at a newspaper.

08:38.640 --> 08:39.950
I need to report for duty next week.

08:39.950 --> 08:40.760
A newspaper?

08:40.760 --> 08:41.159
Mm.

08:41.280 --> 08:42.190
Do you like it?

08:43.570 --> 08:44.450
Well...

08:45.400 --> 08:47.240
I wouldn't say I like it.

08:47.640 --> 08:48.280
But

08:48.550 --> 08:49.750
I want to give it a try.

08:49.860 --> 08:50.460
It's okay.

08:50.520 --> 08:52.250
I think you'll do great.

08:55.640 --> 08:57.440
-I'm so happy!
-You're so happy.

09:00.070 --> 09:00.920
I have a question.

09:00.920 --> 09:01.280
Mm?

09:01.760 --> 09:04.530
Why did someone say
that even if 2 people love each other,

09:04.530 --> 09:06.060
they might still separate?

09:06.520 --> 09:08.280
We love each other very much now,

09:08.280 --> 09:10.430
but I think we'll never be apart.

09:11.520 --> 09:12.790
Someone?

09:13.400 --> 09:14.160
Who?

09:15.330 --> 09:16.750
Just someone.

09:18.430 --> 09:19.430
Her surname is Ye.

09:19.520 --> 09:20.540
She's a professor.

09:20.540 --> 09:21.280
Right?

09:22.000 --> 09:22.430
Mm.

09:23.040 --> 09:24.040
Tell me, why?

09:24.430 --> 09:27.030
Professor Ye and Shan
clearly love each other.

09:27.280 --> 09:28.550
Everyone knows that

09:28.790 --> 09:29.920
except themselves.

09:31.670 --> 09:33.040
Their relationship

09:33.130 --> 09:34.590
is indeed quite complicated.

09:34.590 --> 09:35.450
But I think

09:35.520 --> 09:37.430
if we were in that situation,

09:38.000 --> 09:38.920
it wouldn't be like that.

09:38.920 --> 09:40.360
I would definitely take the initiative
and tell you

09:40.360 --> 09:42.160
I like you very, very, very much.

09:42.560 --> 09:45.500
♪ Boba tea with sugar means I like you ♪

09:44.040 --> 09:47.110
And I like you
very, very, very, very much.

09:46.050 --> 09:47.390
♪ Warm palms ♪

09:48.010 --> 09:49.520
♪ The pleasant smell of love ♪

09:49.870 --> 09:52.070
♪ I sync my playlist with yours
in secret ♪

09:49.920 --> 09:50.450
Besides,

09:50.520 --> 09:52.790
you'll never have that chance
in this lifetime.

09:52.130 --> 09:53.140
♪ Let our hearts beat in sync ♪

09:53.210 --> 09:54.500
♪ Let us breathe in sync ♪

09:53.360 --> 09:53.790
Okay.

09:55.180 --> 09:58.180
♪ You are everything I want ♪

09:57.280 --> 09:58.120
Faster.

09:58.550 --> 09:59.480
Watch the tempo.

10:01.640 --> 10:02.070
Stop.

10:02.950 --> 10:03.550
Look here.

10:10.790 --> 10:11.400
Again.

10:16.640 --> 10:18.400
Ms. Ye, you're amazing.

10:18.570 --> 10:21.360
You really can predict
every mistake I'll make.

10:22.180 --> 10:24.040
You're so happy
even after being criticized.

10:24.040 --> 10:25.120
You're the first one.

10:25.120 --> 10:27.240
I started later than others.

10:27.670 --> 10:29.600
Just point out anything I do wrong.

10:31.880 --> 10:34.410
Have you ever thought
about studying abroad?

10:34.920 --> 10:36.280
Studying abroad?

10:36.640 --> 10:38.040
I've never thought about it.

10:38.040 --> 10:39.770
I think you should give it a try.

10:39.850 --> 10:42.280
Go to different places
and listen to different music styles.

10:42.280 --> 10:44.340
It will also help your future career.

10:45.160 --> 10:46.280
You mean...

10:46.430 --> 10:47.630
an exchange student?

10:49.270 --> 10:50.790
I think, with my current skill level,

10:50.790 --> 10:53.990
I'm not good enough yet
to compete with them for this spot.

10:54.400 --> 10:55.670
Maybe not before,

10:56.160 --> 10:57.430
but you can try now.

10:57.980 --> 10:59.980
Actually, I have high hopes for you.

11:01.040 --> 11:02.440
Thank you, Professor Ye.

11:05.120 --> 11:05.920
Professor Ye,

11:05.920 --> 11:07.320
it's my turn for a lesson.

11:07.880 --> 11:08.520
Come in.

11:16.040 --> 11:16.670
Stop.

11:17.760 --> 11:19.620
You've made a few mistakes today.

11:20.280 --> 11:22.540
I played it well when I practiced before.

11:22.790 --> 11:23.860
Maybe I'm just...

11:24.020 --> 11:25.040
a bit nervous now.

11:25.280 --> 11:26.410
Don't make excuses.

11:27.160 --> 11:29.290
Have you been practicing 4 hours a day?

11:29.850 --> 11:31.360
I've been doing part-time performances.

11:31.360 --> 11:33.040
Counting the performance time,

11:33.040 --> 11:33.760
it's enough.

11:33.760 --> 11:35.290
Then what do you usually do?

11:36.460 --> 11:37.990
Prepare for other classes.

11:41.280 --> 11:42.170
Luo Ningzi,

11:42.920 --> 11:45.250
there is only one spot
for the exchange student program.

11:45.250 --> 11:47.290
Talented people are everywhere.

11:48.000 --> 11:49.600
If you don't give it your all,

11:49.760 --> 11:51.560
how can you compete with others?

11:51.730 --> 11:52.370
I...

11:55.400 --> 11:56.920
I understand, Professor Ye.

11:56.920 --> 11:57.760
Next time,

11:57.760 --> 12:00.360
I'll definitely practice well
before coming.

12:00.520 --> 12:01.980
Let's stop here for today.

12:03.880 --> 12:04.880
Thank you, Ms. Ye.

12:10.330 --> 12:12.060
Why are you waiting for me here?

12:12.550 --> 12:14.180
Why did you practice so long today?

12:14.180 --> 12:15.510
It's almost lights out.

12:15.780 --> 12:18.220
Professor Ye recommended that I apply
for the exchange student program.

12:18.220 --> 12:19.950
She thinks pretty highly of me.

12:20.040 --> 12:21.640
I think I should give it a try.

12:22.650 --> 12:24.680
You definitely can do it.

12:25.720 --> 12:26.250
Let's go.

12:33.950 --> 12:34.590
Ning.

12:35.070 --> 12:36.000
You're here too.

12:40.050 --> 12:41.650
You're preparing for IELTS?

12:43.070 --> 12:43.520
Yes.

12:43.590 --> 12:45.800
I plan to apply
for the exchange student program.

12:45.800 --> 12:47.310
Do you plan to apply for it too?

12:47.310 --> 12:48.370
We can go together.

12:48.710 --> 12:50.440
I've been preparing all along.

12:50.520 --> 12:51.040
But

12:51.160 --> 12:52.660
the requirements for exchange students
are very high.

12:52.660 --> 12:54.920
I'm afraid you can't meet them right now.

12:55.900 --> 12:57.140
I know.

12:57.280 --> 12:59.010
But I still want to give it a try.

12:59.520 --> 13:00.450
Then I advise you

13:00.550 --> 13:01.950
not to waste your energy.

13:04.050 --> 13:05.710
Why are you talking like that?

13:05.920 --> 13:07.450
I thought you'd support me.

13:07.670 --> 13:09.200
I'm just telling the truth,

13:09.640 --> 13:11.300
to save you from wasting time.

13:11.640 --> 13:13.040
I'm going to class first.

13:20.920 --> 13:21.560
Miss Luo.

13:26.780 --> 13:28.110
Um, I'm getting a call.

13:28.560 --> 13:30.020
You guys eat... eat first.

13:38.080 --> 13:39.350
Here, Miss Luo.

13:40.070 --> 13:41.160
My art gallery

13:41.220 --> 13:42.420
will be opening soon.

13:42.550 --> 13:43.520
I must invite you

13:43.790 --> 13:45.070
to come and support it.

13:46.430 --> 13:47.040
I hope

13:47.160 --> 13:49.560
you can give a wonderful performance then.

13:49.830 --> 13:50.690
What do you say?

13:51.040 --> 13:51.680
Mr. Guo,

13:51.700 --> 13:52.730
of course.

13:52.770 --> 13:55.430
Luo Ningzi and I
will definitely attend on time.

13:55.500 --> 13:56.920
We won't let you down.

14:00.400 --> 14:01.160
Sit.

14:05.410 --> 14:06.070
Here, here.

14:06.160 --> 14:06.620
Mr. Guo,

14:06.790 --> 14:07.590
a toast to you.

14:08.300 --> 14:08.920
Miss Luo,

14:09.040 --> 14:09.670
together?

14:09.850 --> 14:10.330
I...

14:11.310 --> 14:12.950
Um, she can't hold her liquor well.

14:12.950 --> 14:14.010
I'll drink for her.

14:21.100 --> 14:22.960
Mr. Guo, let me refill your glass.

14:25.130 --> 14:26.010
Eat. Eat.

14:26.170 --> 14:26.760
Yu,

14:26.940 --> 14:28.400
I'm not feeling very well.

14:28.640 --> 14:30.300
Please excuse me for a moment.

14:34.100 --> 14:35.100
Um...

14:35.460 --> 14:36.920
I'll go handle it.

14:37.000 --> 14:37.400
Here.

14:54.920 --> 14:55.590
Ning.

14:56.290 --> 14:57.690
He's a major sponsor.

14:58.160 --> 15:00.620
He's funded many musicians
to study abroad.

15:00.990 --> 15:01.530
I am

15:01.760 --> 15:03.160
working with him now.

15:03.270 --> 15:04.560
Only if we secure this deal

15:04.560 --> 15:07.160
will we have
more performance opportunities.

15:09.420 --> 15:10.550
So I hope you

15:10.810 --> 15:13.070
can talk more and express yourself more.

15:13.430 --> 15:14.400
Only this way

15:14.430 --> 15:16.160
can we seize this opportunity.

15:17.310 --> 15:18.310
What do you think?

15:18.550 --> 15:19.550
Mm, I understand.

15:20.360 --> 15:21.070
So...

15:29.380 --> 15:30.640
Are you okay, Miss Luo?

15:30.880 --> 15:32.400
I'm fine. Sorry.

15:32.920 --> 15:34.250
I'll drink a toast to you.

15:34.250 --> 15:35.700
Come on. I'll join you.

15:39.280 --> 15:39.760
Ning.

15:40.200 --> 15:41.330
Thank you for today.

15:41.920 --> 15:42.900
I know you're not a drinker,

15:42.900 --> 15:44.430
yet you drank so much for me.

15:44.430 --> 15:45.960
I'm really grateful to you.

15:46.000 --> 15:46.550
It's nothing.

15:46.550 --> 15:47.210
Be careful.

15:47.210 --> 15:47.880
Yu.

15:49.040 --> 15:50.770
Helping you is helping myself.

15:51.160 --> 15:53.620
We will definitely have more performances.

15:54.760 --> 15:56.820
Today, consider it overtime for you.

15:57.310 --> 15:58.940
I'll give you double overtime pay.

15:58.940 --> 16:00.000
Don't turn me down.

16:00.590 --> 16:01.960
Mm. Thanks.

16:02.790 --> 16:05.250
By the way,
is it okay for you to go back alone?

16:05.860 --> 16:06.300
Mm.

16:07.240 --> 16:08.360
Okay. Be careful.

16:08.520 --> 16:09.120
Mm.

16:20.120 --> 16:21.650
We arrived at the same time.

16:21.720 --> 16:23.240
Do you enjoy competing with me that much?

16:23.240 --> 16:24.400
I'm really not at my best today.

16:24.400 --> 16:25.000
Don't...

16:31.070 --> 16:32.100
Now, this is great.

16:32.100 --> 16:33.280
Neither of us can practice.

16:33.280 --> 16:35.190
I think Yi Lan is quite difficult.

16:35.640 --> 16:37.200
She always takes
other people's practice rooms.

16:37.200 --> 16:39.460
And she never holds back when she speaks.

16:40.260 --> 16:42.390
Come out and say it if you have the guts!

16:42.570 --> 16:43.050
Fine.

16:46.920 --> 16:48.800
You two really are good friends.

16:49.140 --> 16:50.350
One lacks integrity,

16:50.750 --> 16:51.480
the other...

16:52.400 --> 16:53.570
lacks integrity too.

16:53.570 --> 16:54.230
Luo Ningzi,

16:54.610 --> 16:57.070
who was that man
who sent you back last night?

16:57.160 --> 16:58.860
You kept throwing up
when you got back to the dorm.

16:58.860 --> 17:00.460
Why don't you just live off-campus?

17:00.460 --> 17:02.090
What does her business
have to do with you?

17:02.090 --> 17:03.690
How is it none of my business?

17:03.730 --> 17:05.060
It's all because of her.

17:05.510 --> 17:08.910
She's out there ruining the reputation
of us music students!

17:09.230 --> 17:11.160
What are you doing, all of you?

17:11.810 --> 17:13.829
You're bullying Tong Xiaole's girlfriend
because you can't have him.

17:13.829 --> 17:15.800
I'm telling you,
this is called bullying, you know?

17:15.800 --> 17:17.030
Wait, who are you?

17:17.270 --> 17:19.800
And what does this have to do
with Tong Xiaole?

17:21.780 --> 17:22.910
They're dormmates?

17:23.960 --> 17:24.730
No wonder.

17:25.160 --> 17:27.089
Birds of a feather flock together.

17:27.200 --> 17:28.660
A bunch of rabble.

17:28.880 --> 17:30.140
No wonder you're at the bottom
of the major rankings.

17:30.140 --> 17:32.800
You've wasted all your time
on things like this.

17:33.770 --> 17:35.820
A bunch of underperforming students.

17:35.820 --> 17:37.220
What's there to show off?

17:37.920 --> 17:38.360
Also,

17:38.730 --> 17:40.530
who did you say lacks integrity?

17:41.570 --> 17:43.250
Try touching my cello again!

17:45.320 --> 17:47.930
Even my parents have never slapped me,
and you slapped me?

17:47.930 --> 17:48.840
You want to fight, huh?

17:48.840 --> 17:49.470
What are you doing?

17:49.470 --> 17:50.840
Go away!

17:50.840 --> 17:52.240
She slapped you! So what?

17:54.080 --> 17:55.140
What are you doing?

17:56.190 --> 17:57.030
Stop it!

17:57.920 --> 17:58.470
Let go!

17:58.900 --> 17:59.580
Let go!

18:00.160 --> 18:00.710
Yi Lan!

18:00.770 --> 18:01.330
Yi Lan!

18:01.640 --> 18:02.400
Xiaole.

18:03.990 --> 18:06.160
Why did you have to fight
instead of talking things out?

18:06.160 --> 18:07.760
Your girlfriend started it!

18:07.920 --> 18:09.050
I slapped her first.

18:09.470 --> 18:10.710
They touched my cello.

18:10.710 --> 18:11.790
Yi Lan was just trying to help me.

18:11.790 --> 18:12.550
See?

18:13.470 --> 18:14.640
She hangs out with Luo Ningzi.

18:14.640 --> 18:15.840
She can't be any good!

18:16.090 --> 18:17.850
Do your words have to be so harsh?

18:17.850 --> 18:19.850
Xiaole, let us handle it ourselves.

18:26.110 --> 18:26.800
You guys

18:27.470 --> 18:29.430
have seriously disrupted our practice.

18:29.430 --> 18:31.120
We came to the practice room first.

18:31.120 --> 18:32.550
You guys started this whole thing.

18:32.550 --> 18:34.350
Who has disturbed whom exactly?

18:34.640 --> 18:36.160
And regarding Luo Ningzi's matters,

18:36.160 --> 18:37.710
who are you to judge her?

18:38.600 --> 18:40.130
About what happened today,

18:40.400 --> 18:41.980
I will tell the student advisor.

18:41.980 --> 18:42.780
Just you wait.

18:44.230 --> 18:45.320
You can snitch,

18:45.320 --> 18:46.830
but we can't snitch, huh?

18:47.230 --> 18:47.920
Exactly.

18:48.320 --> 18:49.180
How old are you?

18:49.330 --> 18:51.160
When something happens,
all you do is run to the teacher.

18:51.160 --> 18:52.990
Coming to school is for learning.

18:52.990 --> 18:55.650
If you have the guts,
let's compete in our field.

18:58.530 --> 18:59.330
Fine.

18:59.840 --> 19:00.610
How?

19:00.950 --> 19:01.640
A duet.

19:01.780 --> 19:02.760
Yi Lan and me.

19:03.050 --> 19:03.730
The losers

19:04.230 --> 19:05.640
apologize publicly.

19:09.970 --> 19:10.900
Next Wednesday,

19:11.800 --> 19:13.260
see you in the auditorium.

19:17.350 --> 19:18.350
Is your foot okay?

19:20.520 --> 19:22.050
I sprained it a bit just now.

19:22.620 --> 19:23.600
Can you still walk?

19:23.600 --> 19:24.400
Let me try.

19:26.710 --> 19:28.040
Be careful. Be careful.

19:28.560 --> 19:29.020
Come on.

19:30.260 --> 19:32.160
Let me take you to the infirmary.

19:37.170 --> 19:38.840
[Healthy Life
Take Control by Yourself]

19:38.810 --> 19:39.530
Doctor?

19:39.670 --> 19:44.440
[Treatment Room]

19:41.350 --> 19:42.080
Not here.

19:43.290 --> 19:44.290
Here. Be careful.

19:44.910 --> 19:46.460
Let's sit over here.

19:45.550 --> 19:49.660
[Healthy Life
Take Control by Yourself]

19:51.970 --> 19:59.920
[Healthy Life
Take Control by Yourself]

19:52.160 --> 19:53.090
Here, let me see.

19:58.030 --> 19:58.400
Does it hurt?

19:58.400 --> 19:59.200
It hurts a lot.

20:00.440 --> 20:01.170
Does it hurt?

20:01.710 --> 20:02.640
A little.

20:03.670 --> 20:05.160
Wait a second.
I'll go get you an ice pack.

20:05.160 --> 20:05.620
No need.

20:05.880 --> 20:07.880
Let's just wait for the doctor here.

20:09.270 --> 20:10.560
Then put your foot like this.

20:10.560 --> 20:12.420
It helps with blood circulation.

20:19.600 --> 20:20.430
What's wrong?

20:23.800 --> 20:24.640
Tell me,

20:25.160 --> 20:26.400
why did Luo Ningzi

20:26.670 --> 20:27.950
ask me to do a duet?

20:29.690 --> 20:31.620
She didn't ask for your permission

20:31.950 --> 20:34.230
and dragged you into a competition.

20:34.920 --> 20:35.950
Aren't you angry?

20:38.950 --> 20:39.710
No.

20:40.230 --> 20:41.080
I just...

20:42.320 --> 20:43.720
don't quite understand.

20:43.960 --> 20:44.480
Yi Lan.

20:46.310 --> 20:48.010
No matter what happens in the future,

20:48.010 --> 20:49.170
you can tell me.

20:49.480 --> 20:50.910
We can solve it together.

20:52.640 --> 20:53.400
Got it.

20:53.640 --> 20:55.640
But I can handle some things myself.

20:56.230 --> 20:56.780
Fine.

20:57.080 --> 20:58.920
If you can handle everything yourself,
you won't need me.

20:58.920 --> 21:00.510
Of course I need you.

21:00.750 --> 21:02.830
But you have your own things to do.

21:03.290 --> 21:05.500
And I don't want you
to become like my dad,

21:05.500 --> 21:06.990
worrying about me over everything.

21:06.990 --> 21:08.710
This isn't worrying.

21:09.300 --> 21:10.120
This is called

21:10.320 --> 21:12.050
the happiness of being needed.

21:12.640 --> 21:13.320
Okay.

21:13.430 --> 21:15.670
Then I'll tell you every little thing
from now on.

21:15.670 --> 21:17.020
Just don't find me annoying.

21:17.020 --> 21:18.020
You'd better.

21:19.880 --> 21:20.510
Let me see.

21:21.230 --> 21:21.920
Is your head okay?

21:21.920 --> 21:22.750
It's fine.

21:23.640 --> 21:24.700
The doctor is here.

21:32.330 --> 21:32.850
Well...

21:33.130 --> 21:34.330
I'll let you two talk.

21:35.010 --> 21:36.810
I'll just go look for the doctor.

21:55.470 --> 21:56.950
About what happened just now,

21:56.950 --> 21:57.800
thank you.

21:59.700 --> 22:00.570
It's nothing.

22:01.840 --> 22:03.510
Aren't we best friends?

22:10.080 --> 22:11.160
Why did you...

22:11.640 --> 22:13.430
ask me to do a duet with you?

22:15.160 --> 22:16.420
Why so many questions?

22:16.660 --> 22:17.460
To win.

22:19.140 --> 22:20.710
But you know clearly with my skill level,

22:20.710 --> 22:21.950
we can't beat them.

22:22.750 --> 22:23.640
With your current skill level,

22:23.640 --> 22:24.320
we can.

22:25.520 --> 22:27.420
Have I improved that much?

22:27.440 --> 22:28.740
Enough to beat them?

22:29.560 --> 22:31.620
I saw you in Professor Ye Mei's class.

22:31.710 --> 22:33.910
You certainly have what it takes to win.

22:35.090 --> 22:36.630
So all this time...

22:38.000 --> 22:39.100
that is why?

22:41.140 --> 22:43.190
Haven't you been well-prepared all along?

22:43.190 --> 22:45.250
Are you worried I'll get ahead of you,

22:46.190 --> 22:47.250
or do you think

22:48.470 --> 22:50.160
I'm not qualified to compete with you?

22:50.160 --> 22:50.890
I don't know.

22:51.570 --> 22:52.250
I just know

22:52.330 --> 22:53.590
there's only one spot,

22:54.190 --> 22:55.120
and I can't lose.

22:55.420 --> 22:57.550
So you're worried I'll take your spot?

23:00.990 --> 23:01.560
Yes.

23:01.670 --> 23:02.510
I'm worried.

23:06.400 --> 23:09.450
You have the support of people around you
in everything you do.

23:09.450 --> 23:11.450
You have your own steadfast dreams.

23:12.080 --> 23:12.910
I envy you.

23:14.980 --> 23:15.680
And me?

23:16.240 --> 23:17.420
Because apples are good for health,

23:17.420 --> 23:18.450
I have to eat them all the time.

23:18.450 --> 23:19.470
Because I have a talent for the cello,

23:19.470 --> 23:21.470
I have to play the cello all the time.

23:21.680 --> 23:22.940
But you're different.

23:23.720 --> 23:25.890
You can do whatever makes you happy.

23:28.510 --> 23:29.820
So I also asked myself,

23:30.240 --> 23:31.380
what do I want?

23:37.160 --> 23:38.120
So...

23:39.060 --> 23:40.320
do you have the answer?

23:40.460 --> 23:41.220
No.

23:46.500 --> 23:47.650
I want to do well,

23:48.290 --> 23:49.490
but I want to know more

23:49.760 --> 23:52.490
whether I play the cello
for myself or for others.

23:54.340 --> 23:54.990
Ning.

23:56.850 --> 23:57.850
You know what?

23:59.970 --> 24:00.900
I envied you too.

24:03.430 --> 24:04.910
In my eyes,

24:06.760 --> 24:08.960
you've always been someone who shines.

24:10.340 --> 24:12.200
You've always been my role model.

24:14.930 --> 24:16.350
I want to tell you,

24:17.980 --> 24:19.610
whether it's for yourself

24:20.160 --> 24:21.400
or for others,

24:23.050 --> 24:24.930
you deserve what you like.

24:28.410 --> 24:29.770
I really like you.

24:32.470 --> 24:33.110
Thank you.

25:04.560 --> 25:09.240
[Student Practice Room 15]

25:19.640 --> 25:21.920
Do you want
to choose a piece for our duet?

25:24.670 --> 25:25.470
Sure.

25:32.970 --> 25:34.230
Do you have any ideas?

25:35.720 --> 25:36.740
Vivaldi.

25:36.760 --> 25:38.360
The Concerto for Two Cellos.

25:40.010 --> 25:41.460
Why this piece again?

25:42.160 --> 25:43.220
I want to play it...

25:43.300 --> 25:44.190
with you again.

25:45.760 --> 25:46.760
Let's try it then.

25:48.040 --> 25:49.160
You start first, as before.

25:49.160 --> 25:49.650
Mm.

25:50.160 --> 25:50.920
Don't go!

25:51.000 --> 25:52.130
Explain it clearly!

25:52.130 --> 25:53.320
Don't! Don't! Don't get physical!

25:53.320 --> 25:54.640
Explain it clearly!

25:54.640 --> 25:56.210
Let's talk this out properly.

25:56.210 --> 25:57.400
Can you let me explain it clearly?

25:57.400 --> 25:59.190
You can't solve the problem like this.

25:59.190 --> 26:01.030
Who do you think you are?

26:01.320 --> 26:03.450
Do you still want to get married or not?

26:08.060 --> 26:09.680
What is that man doing?

26:10.110 --> 26:11.570
How could he act like this?

26:11.670 --> 26:12.670
Look. Look. Look.

26:12.670 --> 26:13.900
What's going on?

26:13.930 --> 26:15.260
Look, you've messed up.

26:39.400 --> 26:40.200
What's wrong?

26:41.560 --> 26:42.960
I bumped into your cello?

26:43.130 --> 26:45.160
You should have watched
where you were going.

26:45.160 --> 26:46.230
Next time you go out,

26:46.230 --> 26:47.430
remember to bring your eyes.

26:47.430 --> 26:48.800
It was clearly you who bumped into me.

26:48.800 --> 26:50.530
Why are you blaming the victim?

26:52.160 --> 26:53.880
I really can't stand

26:53.880 --> 26:55.410
this pitiful look of yours.

26:55.490 --> 26:57.290
Who are you putting on a show for?

26:58.030 --> 26:59.640
Let's not wait until next week.

26:59.640 --> 27:00.240
Right now,

27:00.850 --> 27:01.910
let's have a match.

27:05.750 --> 27:06.610
Are you scared?

27:07.360 --> 27:08.150
Fine, let's do it.

27:08.150 --> 27:08.560
Come on.
